<view class="lx-page"><field-nav/><view class="lx-content"><view class="lx-kicker">MY FIELD</view><view class="lx-title">我的场域</view><view class="lx-subtitle">你已交换的内容、生命档案与有效权益都在这里。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="lx-loading">正在同步权益…</view><block wx:else><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">生命档案与已开启内容</view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="lx-empty lx-veil">尚未开启付费内容。<br/>先去场域精测，完成资料采集与初读。</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="lx-card lx-veil order" data-order="{{item}}" bindtap="openOrder"><view class="lx-card-title">{{item.submission_name || item.productName}}</view><view class="lx-card-note">权益已开启 · {{item.paid_at}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.submission_id}}" class="arrow">{{opening === item.id ? '正在打开…' : '打开完整档案 →'}}</view><view wx:else class="arrow">有效权益 ✓</view></view></view><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">有效权益</view><view wx:if="{{!unlocks.length}}" class="lx-card lx-veil"><view class="lx-card-note">目前没有单独的订阅权益。</view></view><view wx:for="{{unlocks}}" wx:key="product_id" class="benefit lx-veil"><view>{{item.productName || item.product_id}}</view><view class="benefit-date">{{item.expires_at ? '有效至 ' + item.expires_at : '永久有效'}}</view></view></view><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">账号连接</view><view class="lx-card lx-veil"><view class="lx-card-note">小程序身份已经安全建立。打开完整档案时会以同一身份进入灵犀场，不需要再次注册或输入密码。</view></view></view></block></view></view>
